#N canvas 100 60 1300 800 12;
#X text 20 -30 Bass instrument: one oscillator (saw \, square or both) with a swarm of detuned copies \, a sub and noise \, an aggressive low-pass or band-pass filter \, three envelopes (amp \, filter \, pitch) \, an LFO to the filter \, FM or pitch \, and drive. Settings on <prefix>-<name>.;
#X obj 1400 20 loadbang;
#X obj 30 20 inlet;
#X obj 30 50 ockm-instvoice bass \$1;
